    "Description": "redhat.leapp Ansible collection that handles RHEL upgrades.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* ansible-collection-redhat-leapp: ansible-collection-redhat-leapp: Information disclosure of PostgreSQL data via insecure backup permissions (CVE-2026-68563)\n\n* ansible-collection-redhat-leapp: ansible-collection-redhat-leapp: Information disclosure via Leapp report tampering (CVE-2026-68562)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
